SubtitleCat.com
---------------
SubtitleCat.com is an optional third-party service.
GridPlayer Alabaster is not affiliated with or endorsed by it. It bundles
no SubtitleCat.com account, key, cookies or subtitle content, and only acts on
the user's own signed-in session when the user clicks.
